 "notes": [
  "No EXEC CICS, EXEC SQL, IMS or MQ in any of the 14 programs (grep of all lines, case-insensitive), so has_exec_cics is false everywhere.",
  "All CALL targets are string literals; no variable targets, so no ?dynamic edges.",
  "CBSTM03B is never named in an EXEC PGM=; it is only CALLed by CBSTM03A (app/cbl/CBSTM03A.CBL lines 351..909). By the guide rule its four data edges are ds:dd:CBSTM03B.* with resolved false. The files actually resolve through the CBSTM03A step: app/jcl/CREASTMT.JCL:83-86 (TRXFL.VSAM.KSDS, CARDXREF.VSAM.KSDS, ACCTDATA.VSAM.KSDS, CUSTDATA.VSAM.KSDS).",
  "CBSTM03A has no SELECT for TRNXFILE/XREFFILE/CUSTFILE/ACCTFILE (they are opened through CBSTM03B via ALTER/GO TO and CALL, lines 296-310, 726-810), so it has data edges for STMTFILE and HTMLFILE only.",
  "CBTRN01C is not run by any JCL or proc (grep PGM=CBTRN01C finds nothing), so all six of its data edges are ds:dd:CBTRN01C.* unresolved.",
  "CBIMPORT selects CARDOUT (app/cbl/CBIMPORT.cbl:63) but STEP01 of app/jcl/CBIMPORT.jcl defines only EXPFILE, CUSTOUT, ACCTOUT, XREFOUT, TRNXOUT, ERROUT. So ds:dd:CBIMPORT.CARDOUT is unresolved.",
  "CBTRN03C runs in both app/jcl/TRANREPT.jcl STEP10R and app/proc/TRANREPT.prc STEP10R with identical DSNs, so one edge per dataset.",
  "GDG DSNs drop the (+1): AWS.M2.CARDDEMO.SYSTRAN (CBACT04C), DALYREJS (CBTRN02C), TRANSACT.DALY and TRANREPT (CBTRN03C).",
  "app/jcl/CREASTMT.JCL:90 has junk text after the SPACE parameter ('00,RECFM=FB), ATA.VSAM.KSDS'); JCL treats it as a comment because the parameter list ends at the blank after the comma, and the is on line 91 (STATEMNT.PS).",
  "app/jcl/INTCALC.jcl:31 has DD XREFFIL1 (CARDXREF.VSAM.AIX.PATH) that CBACT04C never selects (it uses XREFFILE only), so no edge for it.",
  "Layout copybooks follow the guide strictly (FD COPY, READ INTO, WRITE FROM). Empty lists mean the record is inline, is written without FROM, or is only read into a linkage buffer. Doubtful spots: CBTRN03C REPORT-FILE (records built by MOVE from CVTRA07Y items), CBTRN01C customer/card/transaction files (opened, never read, copybook only in WORKING-STORAGE), CBSTM03B files (READ INTO LK-M03B-FLDT; CBSTM03A then MOVEs FLDT into CARD-XREF-RECORD/CUSTOMER-RECORD/ACCOUNT-RECORD from CVACT03Y/CUSTREC/CVACT01Y).",
  "CBACT01C mode: OUTFILE, ARRYFILE, VBRCFILE opened OUTPUT so write. The account file is read only (OPEN INPUT line 319).",
  "COBSWAIT (ACCEPT FROM SYSIN, no SELECT) and CSUTLDTC (no files) have no data edges. COBSWAIT calls MVSWAIT (app/asm), CSUTLDTC calls CEEDAYS.",
  "CVCUS01Y.cpy and CUSTREC.cpy both define 01 CUSTOMER-RECORD. CBSTM03A copies CUSTREC; every other program that touches customers copies CVCUS01Y.",
  "No entry_points listed: entry points for the batch programs are the JCL jobs, which other labelers cover. Node entry_point flags are left out for the same reason."
 ]
